Interpretability visualizations: Grad-CAM, attention maps, ASAM-vs-Grad-CAM
agreement, and t-SNE. Faithful ports of the corresponding Zenodo.rar files
(named in each docstring), turned into functions.

Shared inputs used throughout:
  best_model   -- the loaded best-fold Keras model
  class_names  -- list of class name strings
  sample_images -- dict {class_name: preprocessed_image}, one per class
                    (see get_sample_images below; matches "sample_images"
                    used across the original GRAD-CAM / ATTENTION scripts)
